<title>PHILIPPINES: Benpres unit buys shrs in cell phone firm.</title>
<headline>Benpres unit buys shrs in cell phone firm.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayan Telecommunications Holdings Corp, a unit of Benpres Holdings Corp, said on Monday it has acquired a 46.62 percent stake in cellular phone firm Express Telecommunications Co Inc (Extelcom).</p>
<p>In a statement, Bayantel said it acquired the shares from Marifil Holdings Corp.</p>
<p>The amount paid for the shares was not disclosed.</p>
</text>
